ed \\]\nThus, our function constraint quadratic \\(h(x)\\le x\\), leading straightforward:\n\\[ h(7)\\le 7 \\]\n\nMaximum using \\(h(7) = 7, \\ h(1) = 7, h(2) = 7, ..., h(6) = 7, conform and maximize's 7.\n\n\\boxed{7}",
